Validation 7. Audit completeness.

Validation 8. Moderation completeness.

Validation 9. Response target consistency. Every response target must exist.

Validation 10. Validity consistency. The validity must be consistent with the argument type.

Validation 11. Soundness consistency. The soundness must be consistent with the validity and the premises.

